&lt;p&gt;The hero is called to the residence of the absurdly rich millionaire Ludman where he is graced by the company of three beautiful bachelorettes. Inside, the owner of the astute mansion suddenly declares to him:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Over the course of three days, you may spend all the time you desire with these ladies. Should one of them spark your interest, it would be best to choose one of them to become your bride.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Orekore!</title><link>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/13571/</link><pubDate>Mon, 31 Dec 2007 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/13571/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ゲーム情報"&gt;ゲーム情報&lt;/h2&gt;
